<title>RUSSIA: Rouble unchanged at 5,434 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble unchanged at 5,434 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was unchanged at 5,434 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX). Dealers said the central bank sold $0.32 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Oct 16		  Oct 15</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,434		   5,434</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	12.06		   4.59</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
